{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-09_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-09",
  "title": "再見，只為再見",
  "storyCode": "M8-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6713f9e2cb1f3da458df1f5733cd34a066a538c7d888bb879091da95524e3368",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "哈，哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "羅德島的醫療技術......是比我們的強......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "向各個感染者聚落派遣醫護人員也在我們的計畫之內，但是戰亂地區的話，讓普通醫療幹員前去，太危險了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "沒事，已經......可以了。這樣包紮就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "敵人撤退了。戰場變大了。我沒法再用那個法術，找不到他們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "那就靠我們的魔族佬吧，他們也很擅長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "感謝你，羅德島的戰士。沒有你的驍勇作戰，我們的人員傷亡是不可避免的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "我剛才聽到了，羅德島的領袖。卡特斯人，你要獨自前往指揮塔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......是，也不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "解釋一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "面對塔露拉的時候，可能只會有我一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "也許，會有一位來自龍門的戰士幫助我......但我假定只有我一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "你一個人怎麼殺死她？你不是大尉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "但是，各位也不是。我們人越多，戰鬥起來就越束手束腳，何況塔露拉比愛國者先生更擅長短時間內壓制戰場的法術。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我要帶一支小隊進去，只是因為指揮塔內必定也還有其他敵人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "夠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我相信我的小隊成員。他們都是最可靠也最擅長應對各種狀況的戰士。如果有我們沒法處理的情況，我們會徵求你們的幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "你想將我們排除在決戰之外？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "不，我不想主導這次戰鬥，只不過，先生，遊擊隊有只有你們才能處理的戰場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "你想讓我們阻止其他人進入指揮塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "......阿米婭，你不想讓我去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "在指揮塔外的戰場上你會更安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "你不想讓我和你一起戰鬥嗎？我們兩個人對抗塔露拉......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "迷迭香，塔露拉的法術飽含能量，你也許很擅長處理各種物理上的傷害方式，但是，火焰的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "可我......可她......她殺了Ace，殺了我那麼多的親人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我為什麼不能去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我不擅長......我該怎麼辦？我能怎麼辦？我以前也有很多事情不擅長的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "你恨塔露拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "不然呢，不然呢！我難道不能恨她嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "迷迭香......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "你問的這些我也沒有答案。我不能說你不能恨一個你沒見過的人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "只是，迷迭香......分別之前，我有一個命令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "命令？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "命令一定要遵守......凱爾希說過，精英幹員要做到。我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "——Logos在我們臨走前也對我說過，愛國者一生很少把別人稱作強敵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "以至於他喜歡用符號、特徵和裝備稱呼別人，反而不太用姓名和種族來代指。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "但是他在剛才，他用菲林來叫你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "也許他認可你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "他也這麼叫你，他叫你卡特斯。認可什麼？認可我這副讓人害怕的樣子嗎？我不想被這麼看待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......但是，如果說許多人把我們當作怪物，那愛國者先生已經被當作怪物很多很多年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們的身體裡都藏著可怕的法術，沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "但他當我們是人。當我們是......人類。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "不是同類嗎？都是些......可怕的，一直會被人討厭的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "不。你看看這些遊擊隊戰士，這些跟隨過其他整合運動領袖的戰士，我們的戰士......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "好的作為會贏得別人尊敬。壞的行為會被別人嫌惡討厭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們的所作所為才是別人判斷我們的途徑。就像隊員們擁護你，就像盾衛擁護愛國者，就像我們願意信任凱爾希醫生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "迷迭香，我的命令是，你要活下去，也要保證大家能夠盡可能地活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "為此，哪怕我會死去，你也不能來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "阿米婭！可你是......我的朋友，我怎麼能讓......讓你一個人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "不！迷迭香。我保證。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我保證我也會活著回來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "所以，不管有人說了什麼，不管有人說我遭遇了什麼，我們都要各自做主，先完成我們自己的目標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們都要活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "這個命令，也給在場的所有人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "活下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "切城營救行動，是為了拯救生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "核心城潛入行動，也是為了拯救生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "我們不說“為了某種事業我們能拋棄生命”，不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "生命是寶貴的，是重要的，是屬於各位自己的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "沒有人，沒有任何一個人，能夠代我們浪費掉這次生命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "......沒有什麼犧牲是必要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "這種說辭，一定是錯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "Guard！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "text": "......我在聽，阿米婭......羅德島的領袖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "對於整合運動也是一樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "卡特斯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "嗯。您說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "這裡就交給我們吧。菲林，我們走！去給這隻小兔子創造一片理想的戰場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "啊......阿米婭......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "一定要做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": ".......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "我知道了。我一定會做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "嗯，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "阿米婭小隊的成員們，跟我走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "text": "各位，我們活著再見面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅德島近衛幹員？",
      "text": "再見......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "再見！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "那我們，該做我們的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "那麼，就按遊擊隊這一套來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "我們的戰場可不在這一小塊地方！來吧！讓我們把這幾條街區，全都變成我們的戰區！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "text": "羅德島，走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "重複一遍，陳警司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我說的還不夠清楚？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "很清楚。清楚到我懷疑自己聽錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "陳警員，這不在你的職權範圍之內。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "法律有國度之分，公理卻沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "維多利亞皇家近衛學院教了你什麼？它有教你腳踏實地，不要好高騖遠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我已經畢業了。我已經是一個為龍門服務的警員了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "那我重複一遍，聽好，“我的志願是加入近衛局，之後，我會加入特別督查組”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "我會捍衛這座城市，也會讓它變得更乾淨。那種事不會再發生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "哪種事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "你是真的健忘，還是故意裝傻？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "注意你的言辭，陳警員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "抱歉，長官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "報告魏長官，我所指的是距今十年前，龍門遭到外部勢力侵入，市民遭到綁架並自此失蹤的事件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "在我加入近衛局後，我依然會推動龍門對失蹤人口的進一步調查和追索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "陳......你不知道你在說什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "報告長官，我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "我不會反對的。那就這樣吧，當你做不下去以後，就告訴我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彥吾",
      "text": "陳警司，你想在近衛局幹幾年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我沒回他。\n這麼多年過來，我一直想的是，我還能幹多久？我還要幹多久？\n只是現在我才發現，原來這個答案，一直不是我能決定的。\n最近赤霄劍在我手裡越來越鈍。我得到什麼時候才會理解，絕影不是逐影而行、絕不放手，而是不再回頭？\n“淚鋒之劍，當棄即棄。”"
    }
  ]
}
